[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0023","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0023.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-8720","title":"Apple WebKit 内存损坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple WebKit 存在内存损坏漏洞，当用户使用受影响版本的 Safari 浏览器或其他基于 WebKit 的应用程序处理恶意构造的网页内容时，攻击者可利用该漏洞触发内存损坏，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 iOS、iPadOS、macOS 等使用 WebKit 引擎的 Apple 操作系统及应用程序。攻击需要用户交互（如点击恶意链接），但无需身份认证，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高。Apple 已在 2019 年 8 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-8720"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2023-03-06T23:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:42:26Z","remediation":"升级 Apple Safari 至 13.0 及以上版本，或升级 iOS 至 12.4 及以上版本，或升级 tvOS 至 12.4 及以上版本，或升级 watchOS 至 5.3 及以上版本。Apple 已通过改进内存处理修复了 WebKit 中的多个内存损坏问题。如无法立即升级，可禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1876611","https://webkitgtk.org/security/WSA-2019-0005.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-8720","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-8720.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2019/8xxx/CVE-2019-8720.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-8720.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-8720.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/active/CVE-2019-8720","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-8720.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/ae03a9d5bcdec0092d3f179316a97b5f3dabc853/osv/cve/2019/UBUNTU-CVE-2019-8720.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-8720.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/bb61d58fed8423b693b044e7ded1ae22a4d818e8/2019/CVE-2019-8720/README.md","https://github.com/sslab-gatech/freedom/blob/353f37c20e27963e1513227b58914419a8138386/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0023.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0123","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0123.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17444","title":"JFrog Artifactory 默认口令漏洞","description":"JFrog Artifactory 在多个版本中为默认管理员账户配置了如 \"password\" 等通用弱口令，且未强制用户在首次登录后修改密码。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可直接利用这些默认凭证登录系统管理后台，从而完全控制 Artifactory 实例，进而篡改制品仓库、植入恶意代码或窃取敏感构件数据。该漏洞影响 6.17.0 之前的所有 Artifactory 版本，攻击无需任何凭据且可在网络可达的任意位置发起，危害极为严重。建议用户立即修改默认管理员密码并升级至最新版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17444"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-10-12T22:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:57Z","remediation":"立即升级 JFrog Artifactory 至 6.17.0 或更高版本，该版本已强制要求修改默认管理员密码。升级后务必登录管理控制台，将 admin 账户密码从默认的 \"password\" 修改为强密码（至少 12 位含大小写数字特殊字符）。若暂时无法升级，请在防火墙层面限制 Artifactory 管理端口（默认 8081/8082）仅允许可信 IP 访问，并立即手动修改所有默认账户密码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.jfrog.com/confluence/display/JFROG/Artifactory+Release+Notes","https://www.jfrog.com/confluence/display/JFROG/JFrog+Artifactory","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17444.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17444.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/735b7181f9cc676afd10704df69ba6e3d23ba358/2019/CVE-2019-17444.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/726e4f078d9c802d5468914ce95f8f208f8ae45a/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17444.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-17444.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-17444-3984.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-17444-3983.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Artifactory/CVE-2019-17444.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-17444.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/jfrog/artifactory/CVE-2019-17444.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17444.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0123.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0123.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0123.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0026","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0026.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0230","title":"Apache Struts2 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Struts2 框架 2.0.0 至 2.5.20 版本中存在强制双重 OGNL 表达式求值漏洞（S2-059），当标签属性中使用了未经过滤的用户输入时，攻击者可通过构造恶意的 OGNL 表达式触发该漏洞，实现远程代码执行。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级为严重。官方已在 2.5.22 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0230"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-09-14T17:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:02Z","remediation":"立即升级 Apache Struts 至 2.5.22 或更高版本，该版本进一步限制了强制双重 OGNL 求值带来的攻击面。如无法立即升级，启用主动 OGNL 表达式注入防护（在 struts.xml 中设置 struts.ognl.enableExpressionEvaluation=false），并严格避免在标签属性中使用 %{...} 或 ${...} 语法引用未经校验的用户输入，仅允许在 value 属性中使用 EL 表达式。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160108/Apache-Struts-2.5.20-Double-OGNL-Evaluation.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160721/Apache-Struts-2-Forced-Multi-OGNL-Evaluation.html","https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/ww/s2-059","https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/2982840","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r1125f3044a0946d1e7e6f125a6170b58d413ebd4a95157e4608041c7%40%3Cannounce.apache.org%3E","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r90890afea72a9571d666820b2fe5942a0a5f86be406fa31da3dd0922%40%3Cannounce.apache.org%3E","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuApr2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2021.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49068","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-0230.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2019/CVE-2019-0230.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/400ed050b78dffbc3594fd5bafe67494479fdfd3/2019/CVE-2019-0230.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e80f5d408ffad16b39381a0b04b1a01a2a54c308/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-0230.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-0230.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-0230-3678.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-0230-3680.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-0230-3679.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2019-0230-3682.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2019-0230_重复副本.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2019-0230.yaml","https://github.com/ramoncjs3/CVE-2019-0230","https://github.com/BH2UOL/CVE-2019-0230","https://github.com/PrinceFPF/CVE-2019-0230","https://github.com/Al1ex/CVE-2019-0230","https://github.com/gh0st27/Struts2Scanner"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0026.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1309","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1309.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-5591","title":"Fortinet FortiOS 默认配置致LDAP仿冒信息泄露漏洞","description":"Fortinet FortiOS 存在默认配置漏洞，当设备配置使用 LDAP 进行用户认证时，系统未对 LDAP 服务器身份进行充分验证。同一子网内的未经身份认证的攻击者可通过伪造 LDAP 服务器响应，实施中间人攻击，诱使 FortiOS 设备将敏感认证信息（包括用户凭证）发送至攻击者控制的服务器，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞影响 FortiOS 全系列版本，攻击者只需与目标处于同一广播域即可利用，无需任何认证，CVSS 评分 6.5，危害等级中危。Fortinet 已在安全公告中建议用户启用 LDAP over TLS 并配置证书验证以缓解此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-5591"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-08-14T16:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:37:54Z","remediation":"升级 FortiOS 至 6.2.1 及以上版本，并在 CLI 中执行 config user ldap → edit <ldap-server> → set ca-cert <LDAP服务器证书> → set secure ldaps → set server-identity-check enable 以启用 LDAP 服务器身份校验。从 6.0.3-6.2.0 升级到 6.2.1 后不会自动启用该选项，需手动配置。如无法升级，可在同一子网内通过防火墙策略限制 LDAP 流量仅允许与可信服务器通信作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.fortiguard.com/psirt/FG-IR-19-037","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-5591","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-5591.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-5591.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2019/CVE-2019-5591.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2e0e3782ab192a0dba6edbe5e9deeb3c79e8414c/2019/5xxx/CVE-2019-5591.json","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/96acb02a8d6942d7cdf496f8d887cd0035972f4b/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-5591.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/ed3533775a9ade21f1577e57c130e65e8f80898c/2019/CVE-2019-5591.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-5591.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/96acb02a8d6942d7cdf496f8d887cd0035972f4b/data/2019/CVE-2019-5591-ayewo_fortios-ldap-mitm-poc-CVE-2019-5591.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-5591.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-5591.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-5591.json","https://github.com/ayewo/fortios-ldap-mitm-poc-CVE-2019-5591"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1309.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0117","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0117.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17231","title":"WordPress OneTone主题 存储型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"tags. No extra content.\n\nWait, let me re-read the instructions: \"你可以先简要分析，但**最终答案必须**放在一对 <value>...","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17231"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-04-03T15:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:31Z","remediation":"立即将 OneTone 主题升级至 3.0.7 或更高版本，该版本修复了 includes/theme-functions.php 中的存储型 XSS 漏洞。如短期内无法升级，应在 WordPress 管理后台停用 OneTone 主题并切换至 Twenty Twenty-Four 等受支持的主题。临时缓解措施包括：使用 WordPress 提供的 esc_html()、esc_attr()、wp_kses() 等函数对所有前端输出字段进行转义，在 includes/theme-functions.php 中对用户可控输入进行过滤，在 Web 应用防火墙层配置规则拦截 script、iframe、javascript:、onerror 等常见 XSS 载荷，并设置 wp-content/themes/onetone/ 目录为只读权限，阻止攻击者持久化恶意脚本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.nintechnet.com/unauthenticated-stored-xss-vulnerability-in-wordpress-onetone-theme-unpatched/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17231.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17231.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17231.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17231.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-17231.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-17231-onetone-c2777158-baa4-4209-ae15-03da5adafc75.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2019-17231.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-17231.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-17231-onetone_companion-c2777158-baa4-4209-ae15-03da5adafc75.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-17231.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17231.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0117.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0116","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0116.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17230","title":"WordPress OneTone主题 未授权选项修改漏洞","description":"tags.<value>WordPress OneTone主题（最高至3.0.6版本）及OneTone Companion插件（最高至1.1.1版本）中的includes/theme-functions.php文件存在未授权选项修改漏洞。该文件在处理主题功能时缺少权限校验机制，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过向目标WordPress站点发送特制的HTTP请求，直接触发theme-functions.php中的选项更新功能，在无需登录后台或获取管理员凭据的情况下篡改站点配置选项。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本OneTone主题及插件的WordPress站点，攻击者可利用此漏洞修改主题设置、404页面消息等内容，通过注入恶意JavaScript代码实现存储型跨站脚本攻击（XSS），进而窃取管理员Cookie、篡改网站内容或重定向用户至恶意站点。攻击条件为目标站点运行受影响的OneTone主题或插件版本，攻击者只需构造包含待修改选项名称及值的HTTP POST请求发送至目标站点即可触发漏洞，无需任何认证凭据且无需用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17230"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-04-03T15:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 OneTone 主题至 3.0.7 或更高版本；若无法升级（该主题已停止维护），建议更换为官方维护的其他 WordPress 主题（如 Twenty Twenty-Four 等）。临时缓解：在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截含 action=onetone_options_import 的 POST 请求，或在 wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 添加访问限制。同时检查并清理被篡改的 404 页面内容及其他主题选项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.nintechnet.com/unauthenticated-stored-xss-vulnerability-in-wordpress-onetone-theme-unpatched/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17230.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17230.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17230.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17230.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-17230.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-17230-onetone-a8082c60-436d-42e3-8aa5-cd2cb8ce6355.yaml","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder5/CVE-2019-17230.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-17230.rules","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/d89a4438a6b6037fedd5df1c832dbac48d3b31b3/nuclei-templates/2019/CVE-2019-17230-onetone_companion-a8082c60-436d-42e3-8aa5-cd2cb8ce6355.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-17230.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17230.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0116.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0116.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0116.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0127","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0127.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17564","title":"Apache Dubbo HTTP 协议 Java 反序列化漏洞","description":"Apache Dubbo 是一个分布式服务框架，当 Provider 端启用 HTTP 协议进行远程通信时，存在不安全的 Java 对象反序列化漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标 Dubbo 服务发送包含恶意 Java 对象的特制 HTTP POST 请求，利用 Apache Dubbo 的反序列化机制触发远程代码执行，从而完全接管 Provider 实例。该漏洞影响 Apache Dubbo 2.7.0 至 2.7.4、2.6.0 至 2.6.7 以及所有 2.5.x 版本，攻击复杂度低，无需身份验证且无需用户交互即可利用，CVSS v3.1 评分 9.8（严重等级），可导致服务器被完全控制，危害极大。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17564"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-04-01T22:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:24:10Z","remediation":"1. 立即升级 Apache Dubbo 至 2.7.5、2.6.8 或更高版本，官方已修复 HTTP 协议反序列化漏洞。2. 如暂无法升级，临时关闭 Provider 的 HTTP remoting 支持（仅使用 dubbo 协议），并在防火墙或安全组中限制 Dubbo 端口仅允许受信任的 IP 地址访问。3. 在网关或 WAF 层拦截带有 Java 对象序列化数据的异常 POST 请求作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://advisory.checkmarx.net/advisory/CX-2020-4275","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r13f7a58fa5d61d729e538a378687118e00c3e229903ba1e7b3a807a2%40%3Cdev.dubbo.apache.org%3E","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17564.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17564.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/dubbo/CVE-2019-17564/README.md","https://github.com/vulhub/vulhub/blob/aeaf65793f147f29bd50841ef77f4e9cad07ecc7/dubbo/CVE-2019-17564/README.zh-cn.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/8f8915fb8528acceea10fcd94e24975c98e3301b/2019/CVE-2019-17564.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e69d77919686ca49345deef0427dacfbf759ca46/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17564.yaml","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/dubbo/CVE-2019-17564.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/Apache_Dubbo_CVE-2019-17564_反序列化分析_-_Y4er的博客.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/开发框架漏洞/Apache Dubbo Java反序列化漏洞 CVE-2019-17564.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Vulnerability-Wiki/blob/b32b83c01eabac4d6b4b334852be9cff76ba67ee/docs-base/docs/framework/Apache-Dubbo-Java反序列化漏洞-CVE-2019-17564.md","https://github.com/bit4woo/code2sec.com/blob/97e2647d5f4c1d02472d07bb484356bb1dc17163/CVE-2019-17564 Dubbo HTTP协议反序列化漏洞.md","https://github.com/Dor-Tumarkin/CVE-2019-17564-FastJson-Gadget","https://github.com/fairyming/CVE-2019-17564","https://github.com/Jaky5155/CVE-2019-17564","https://github.com/Hu3sky/CVE-2019-17564","https://github.com/r00t4dm/CVE-2019-17564"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0127.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0097","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0097.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16072","title":"NETSAS Enigma NMS 操作系统命令注入漏洞","description":"NETSAS Enigma NMS（网络管理系统）的 discover_and_manage CGI 脚本中存在操作系统命令注入漏洞。由于该脚本对 ip_address 变量中的 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符等）未进行有效中和处理，在 snmp_browser 操作中直接拼接并传递至系统命令执行，导致攻击者能够注入并执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 NETSAS Enigma NMS 65.0.0 及更早版本，任何可访问该 Web 接口的远程攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，攻击门槛极低。在成功利用后，攻击者可以完全接管目标网络管理系统，读取敏感网络配置信息、篡改管理数据或横向移动至受管设备，从而实现远程代码执行与对整体网络的持久控制。该漏洞 CVSS 评分为 9.8，危害等级严重，建议相关用户尽快升级至修复版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16072"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-03-20T00:17:08Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:21:38Z","remediation":"建议立即将 NETSAS Enigma NMS 升级到已修复漏洞的最新版本（该漏洞影响 65.0.0 及更早版本，需联系厂商 NETSAS 获取含补丁的后续版本并完成升级）。若暂时无法升级，可采取以下缓解措施：1) 在网络边界防火墙或反向代理层阻断对 discover_and_manage CGI 脚本未授权的直接访问，仅允许可信管理系统网段访问；2) 在 WAF 层针对 snmp_browser 动作的 ip_address 参数添加规则，拦截含分号、管道符、$()、反引号等 shell 元字符的请求；3) 在应用层对 ip_address 输入进行严格校验，仅允许合法 IP 格式并拒绝特殊字符；4) 限制 NMS 管理账号权限并加强访问审计，及时排查异常命令执行记录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.mogozobo.com/?p=3647","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47364","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16072.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16072.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16072.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2019/16xxx/CVE-2019-16072.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-16072.md","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/netsas/enigma_network_management_solution/CVE-2019-16072.yaml","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-16072.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-16072.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-16072.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-16072.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16072.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0097.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1108","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1108.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-20500","title":"D-Link DWL-2600AP OS命令注入漏洞","description":"D-Link DWL-2600AP 无线接入点固件版本 4.2.0.15 Rev A 的 Web 管理界面中存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。已通过身份验证的攻击者可利用 Save Configuration 功能，在 admin.cgi?action=config_save 请求的 configBackup 或 downloadServerip 参数中注入 shell 元字符，从而在设备上以 root 权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 DWL-2600AP 系列设备，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。厂商尚未发布官方修复补丁，建议限制管理界面的网络访问范围以降低风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-20500"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-05T15:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:30:35Z","remediation":"立即将 DWL-2600AP Rev A 固件升级至 v4.2.0.17（下载地址：ftp://ftp2.dlink.com/PRODUCTS/DWL-2600AP/REVA/DWL-2600AP_REVA_FIRMWARE_v4.2.0.17.zip）。如无法升级，可在 Web 管理界面中限制可访问 admin.cgi 的管理员 IP 来源，并禁用不必要的配置备份/恢复功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://supportannouncement.us.dlink.com/announcement/publication.aspx?name=SAP10113","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46841","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-20500","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-20500.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0661b1b09ba7a2e855981f4a1781f3b8de7cf562/cves/2019/20xxx/CVE-2019-20500.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2019/20xxx/CVE-2019-20500.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-20500.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-20500.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-20500.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-20500.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-20500.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-20500.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-20500.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1108.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0900","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17026","title":"Mozilla Firefox IonMonkey JIT 类型混淆远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 的 IonMonkey JIT 编译器在设置数组元素时存在类型混淆漏洞。由于 JIT 编译器对数组元素类型别名信息处理错误，导致类型推断出现混淆，攻击者可通过构造特制的 JavaScript 代码诱导用户访问恶意页面，触发类型混淆后实现任意内存读写，最终在受害者系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞已在野外被积极利用，影响 Firefox 72.0.1 之前版本、Firefox ESR 68.4.1 之前版本及 Thunderbird 68.4.1 之前版本。攻击无需身份认证，仅需用户通过浏览器访问恶意页面即可触发。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17026"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-03-02T05:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:11Z","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 至 72.0.1 及以上版本，或 Firefox ESR 至 68.4.1 及以上版本；Thunderbird 用户升级至 68.4.1 及以上版本。该漏洞已被发现在野利用，属于主动攻击漏洞，建议在补丁安装前禁用 Firefox/Thunderbird 的 JavaScript 引擎（设置 javascript.enabled=false）作为临时缓解措施，并关注 Mozilla 安全公告 MFSA2020-03/MFSA2020-04 获取最新补丁信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162568/Firefox-72-IonMonkey-JIT-Type-Confusion.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1607443","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202003-02","https://usn.ubuntu.com/4335-1/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2020-03/","https://www.mozilla.org/security/advisories/mfsa2020-04/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-17026","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49864","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-17026.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2019-17026.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-17026.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17026.json","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/74a17114d313d1fcf11590910ec4d27e95394ac2/2019/CVE-2019-17026.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-17026.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-17026.md","https://github.com/forrest-orr/DoubleStar/blob/e25459a1119ee7d805a3ee4d1ee19f1ef64d7993/CVE-2019-17026/Forrest_Orr_CVE-2019-17026_64-bit.html","https://github.com/forrest-orr/Exploits/blob/86e588f2c688cfea7ddd77f6bdc9b341c32eb579/Standalone/CVE-2019-17026/Forrest_Orr_CVE-2019-17026_64-bit.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2020/CVE-2020-0674.md","https://github.com/forrest-orr/DoubleStar","https://github.com/forrest-orr/Exploits","https://github.com/maxpl0it/CVE-2019-17026-Exploit","https://github.com/lsw29475/CVE-2019-17026"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0900.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0900.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0115","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0115.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-17228","title":"WordPress Motors Car Dealer & Classified Ads 插件身份验证绕过漏洞","description":"WordPress 插件 Motors - Car Dealer & Classified Ads（motors-car-dealership-classified-listings）1.4.0 及以下版本的 includes/options.php 文件存在数据真实性验证不足漏洞。由于该文件在处理选项更新时未对请求进行有效的身份认证和完整性校验，未经身份验证的远程攻击者可直接发送特制 HTTP 请求修改插件配置选项，导致网站功能被篡改或内容被注入。该漏洞影响使用该插件的 WordPress 网站，攻击者可利用其进行配置篡改、内容劫持等恶意操作。CVSS 评分为 6.5，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-17228"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-02-24T19:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:23:30Z","remediation":"立即将 Motors – Car Dealer & Classified Ads 插件升级到 1.4.1 或更高版本（当前最新 1.4.114），官方在 1.4.1 中已修复 includes/options.php 的选项修改验证缺失问题。升级路径：进入 WordPress 后台「插件」→「已安装的插件」，找到 Motors – Car Dealership & Classified Listings 并点击「立即更新」。如后台无更新提示，可下载最新 zip 包后通过「上传插件」覆盖安装。临时缓解措施：在网站根目录 .htaccess 或 Nginx 配置中，限制对 /wp-admin/admin-ajax.php 和 includes/options.php 的未认证 POST 请求，阻断未授权选项修改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blog.nintechnet.com/multiple-vulnerabilities-in-wordpress-motors-car-dealer-classified-ads-plugin/","https://wordpress.org/plugins/motors-car-dealership-classified-listings/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9884","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17228.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-17228.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/1beabb4b11662cd835a2974a73ab3608623a1bdc/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17228.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2019/17xxx/CVE-2019-17228.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-17228.md","https://github.com/linuxadi/40k-nuclei-templates/blob/542be6820c801c02a33aee60f1c05ca7b0b5005f/aditya/folder4/CVE-2019-17228.yaml","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-17228.rules","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-17228.json","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-17228.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-17228.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-17228_4.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0115.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1009","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-19356","title":"Netis WF2419 路由器远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netis WF2419 路由器 Web 管理页面中的 tracert 诊断工具存在 OS 命令注入漏洞。由于对用户输入缺乏有效的过滤和净化处理，已登录 Web 管理页面的攻击者可通过向 tracert 功能提交特制的系统命令参数，以 root 权限在设备上执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响固件版本 V1.2.31805 和 V2.2.36123，攻击者需先获取路由器管理凭据才能利用，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。成功利用可完全控制路由器设备，进而监听网络流量或发起进一步攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-19356"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-07T23:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:26:33Z","remediation":"Netis 官方未发布修复该漏洞的固件更新（已知最后版本 V2.2.36123 仍受影响），建议立即停用 WF2419 路由器并更换为受支持的设备。作为临时缓解措施：在路由器管理界面禁用远程 Web 管理功能，将管理页面仅绑定到内网接口；修改默认管理员密码为强密码；在防火墙层面限制对路由器 80/443 端口的访问来源，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/156588/Netis-WF2419-2.2.36123-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://github.com/shadowgatt/CVE-2019-19356","https://www.digital.security/en/blog/netis-routers-remote-code-execution-cve-2019-19356","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-19356","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-19356.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2019/19xxx/CVE-2019-19356.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-19356.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2019/CVE-2019-19356/CVE-2019-19356_exploit.py","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-19356.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-19356.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-19356.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2019/CVE-2019-19356/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-19356.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-19356.json","https://github.com/qq1515406085/CVE-2019-19356"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1006","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-18988","title":"TeamViewer Desktop 远程登录访问控制绕过漏洞","description":"TeamViewer Desktop 至 14.7.1965 版本存在加密密钥硬编码漏洞，自 v7.0.43148 起所有客户安装均使用相同的共享 AES 密钥加密配置数据。本地攻击者若获知该密钥，可解密存储在注册表或配置文件中的受保护信息。在 v9.x 之前版本中，攻击者可进一步解密无人值守访问密码，从而绕过远程登录访问控制，实现远程登录系统及无界面文件浏览。当前版本虽更改了无人值守访问密码的存储方式，但 OptionsPasswordAES 仍使用同一共享密钥。该漏洞需要攻击者已拥有系统本地会话或能访问离线存储的配置文件，CVSS 评分 7.0，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.0,"aliases":["CVE-2019-18988"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-02-07T16:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:25:42Z","remediation":"立即升级 TeamViewer 至 v15 或更高版本（v15 改用订阅制账户认证，不再使用存在共享 AES 密钥的注册表项）。如无法升级，在 TeamViewer 设置中禁用\"无人值守访问\"的静态密码功能，改用\"轻松访问\"（基于账户认证的动态密码）；同时避免将 TeamViewer 配置导出为 .reg 文件存储到共享目录或云端。对于企业环境，建议通过组策略限制对注册表项 HKCU\\Software\\TeamViewer 的读取权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://community.teamviewer.com/t5/Announcements/Specification-on-CVE-2019-18988/td-p/82264","https://community.teamviewer.com/t5/Knowledge-Base/tkb-p/Knowledgebase?threadtype=label&labels=Security","https://twitter.com/Blurbdust/status/1224212682594770946?s=20","https://whynotsecurity.com/blog/teamviewer/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-18988","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-18988.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-18988.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-18988.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2019/CVE-2019-18988/README.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-18988.json","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2019/CVE-2019-18988.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-18988.json","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/23441ec855d45e03157b693d7c6d0ff023fe3af5/2019/CVE-2019-18988/manual_exploit.bat","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2019/CVE-2019-189xx/CVE-2019-18988.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-18988.md","https://github.com/mr-r3b00t/CVE-2019-18988"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0999","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0999.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-18426","title":"WhatsApp Desktop 跨站脚本与本地文件读取漏洞","description":"WhatsApp Desktop 0.3.9309之前版本在与WhatsApp for iPhone 2.20.10之前版本配对使用时存在跨站脚本与本地文件读取漏洞。攻击者可构造包含恶意链接预览的特制文本消息发送给受害者，当受害者点击该链接预览时，漏洞被触发，导致攻击者能够在受害者浏览器上下文中执行任意JavaScript代码，并读取本地文件系统中的敏感信息。该漏洞影响广泛使用的即时通讯软件，CVSS评分8.2，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-18426"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-01-21T21:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:25:01Z","remediation":"将 WhatsApp Desktop 升级至 0.3.9309 或更高版本，同时将 WhatsApp for iPhone 升级至 2.20.10 或更高版本。可在 WhatsApp 设置中关闭链接预览功能作为临时缓解措施，并教育用户不要点击可疑消息中的链接预览。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/157097/WhatsApp-Desktop-0.3.9308-Cross-Site-Scripting.html","https://www.facebook.com/security/advisories/cve-2019-18426","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-18426","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/48295","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-18426.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-18426.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2019/18xxx/CVE-2019-18426.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2019/18xxx/CVE-2019-18426.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-18426.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-18426.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-18426.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-18426.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-18426.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-18426.json","https://github.com/HumanSecurity/CVE-2019-18426"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-0999.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-0999.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0999.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0104","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0104.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-16469","title":"Adobe Experience Manager 表达式语言注入漏洞","description":"Adobe Experience Manager（AEM）6.0 至 6.5 版本存在表达式语言注入漏洞（CWE-917），由于系统对表达式语言语句中使用的特殊元素转义处理不恰当，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 HTTP 请求注入恶意表达式语言代码。成功利用该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，攻击者可读取服务器端内存中的敏感配置、凭据或其他机密数据。该漏洞利用复杂度低，无需用户交互，攻击者可远程发起利用，影响部署了受影响版本 AEM 的所有实例。Adobe 已在后续安全更新中修复该漏洞，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2019-16469"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2020-01-15T17:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:22:19Z","remediation":"Adobe 官方安全公告 APSB20-01 已发布修复补丁。受影响用户应立即升级 Adobe Experience Manager 至 6.5.3.0 或更高版本，运行 6.4 及更早版本的用户需安装 Adobe 提供的对应 Service Pack。临时缓解措施：在防火墙或反向代理中限制对 AEM 实例的网络访问，仅允许可信 IP 访问 Author 和 Publish 环境，或暂时禁用 DAM 的 metadataeditor.external.html 组件以阻断攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/experience-manager/apsb20-01.html","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16469.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-16469.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16469.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b565ef51c288ce15e405affdff907e4830eb8f32/cves/2019/16xxx/CVE-2019-16469.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/b3b0b04ddffeb4e4ef4cf727feceae2f4993325c/plugins/adobe/experience_manager/CVE-2019-16469.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/49185e9cdc5fc147738c38ed039cc265d56e905d/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-16469.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-16469.rules","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-16469.yaml","https://github.com/youki992/VscanPlus/blob/714a0e276a538a22c1a6215c71458a8b59a920ef/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-16469.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-16469_2.yaml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/552b84dd5dea4e2cd4311197c182e94e76651492/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2019-16469_7.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0104.toml"}]